  "title": {
   "en": "Dead Girl in the Scream House"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "絶叫館の死少女"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Zekkyoukan no Shi Shoujo"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Classmate Yuri manages to go on a date with handsome Yoshida. Frustrated by this, Tomoko casts a curse on her, saying, \"During the date, Yuri's leg will break and the date will have to be cancelled!\" And then, during the date, Yuri actually sprains her leg. Feeling responsible, Tomoko confesses to Yuri that she cast the curse and apologizes. Yuri laughs and forgives, but that night, a creepy bug emerges from her leg... And at the same time, when Yoshida touches Yuri's leg, something grotesque happens to his hand...?! A high school girl who has been living a peaceful life is suddenly thrown into hell. A collection of psycho-horror short stories by Tanima Yumi!"
  },
